# Trivy vulnerability ignore list — frontend container
# -------------------------------------------------------
# These CVEs are in node_modules within the built image. They fall into two
# categories:
# 1. npm's own bundled dependencies (tar, minimatch, cross-spawn, etc.) —
#    npm is not used at runtime in the production container; only Node.js server.js
#    runs. These packages are development/install-time tools.
# 2. Build tooling pinned by eslint-config-next / Next.js internals that do
#    not run in the production server process.
# All are documented and tracked. Review before each expiry date.

# brace-expansion — pinned by eslint-config-next / Next.js internal tooling.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-13149
CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152

# cross-spawn — build tool pinned by eslint-config-next.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2024-21538

# glob — pinned by Next.js internal tooling.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2025-64756

# ip-address — pinned by a deep transitive dep.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-69192

# minimatch — pinned by eslint-config-next and npm's own bundled modules.
# npm is not executed at runtime in the production container.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-26996
CVE-2026-27903
CVE-2026-27904

# tar (node-tar) — bundled with npm (the package manager in the Node.js image).
# npm is not invoked at container runtime; the production container only runs
# `node server.js`. These vulnerabilities require processing a malicious tar
# archive via `npm install`, which never happens at runtime.
# Reviewed: 2026-08-07. Expires: 2026-10-31.
CVE-2026-59873
CVE-2026-23745
CVE-2026-23950
CVE-2026-24842
CVE-2026-26960
CVE-2026-29786
CVE-2026-31802
CVE-2026-48815
CVE-2026-59874
CVE-2026-73566

# pacote — bundled inside npm (usr/local/lib/node_modules/npm/node_modules/pacote)
# in the Node.js base image. npm is the package manager and is not invoked at
# container runtime; the production container only runs `node server.js`.
# Reviewed: 2026-09-05. Expires: 2026-11-30.
CVE-2026-9496
